.TH sam-jail-uninstall 1 2026-11-10 "SAM 0.1.0" "SAM - Sandboxed AppImage Manager"
.SH NAME
sam\-jail\-uninstall \- Remove SAM from this computer: every sandbox (menu entries SAM hid come back), SAM\*(Aqs menu entries, its settings and the apps\*(Aq private data. AppImage files stay. Lists what it would remove without \-\-yes
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsam\-jail uninstall\fR [\fB\-\-keep\-data\fR] [\fB\-\-yes\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Remove SAM from this computer: every sandbox (menu entries SAM hid come back), SAM\*(Aqs menu entries, its settings and the apps\*(Aq private data. AppImage files stay. Lists what it would remove without \-\-yes
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-keep\-data\fR
Keep SAM\*(Aqs settings and the apps\*(Aq private data
.TP
\fB\-\-yes\fR

.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
